chart: initiative-status
title: Enterprise Platform Modernization — Stress Test

tag: Phase alias p
  Discovery(green)
  Design(blue)
  Build(orange)
  Launch(red)
  Maintenance(purple) default

tag: Team alias t
  Frontend(blue)
  Backend(green)
  Platform(teal)
  Data(purple)
  Security(red)
  DevOps(orange)

tag: Priority alias pri
  P0(red)
  P1(orange)
  P2(blue) default

// ── Identity & Access ───────────────────────────────────────

[Identity & Access] | t: Security, pri: P0
  Auth Service | done, p: Build
  SSO Integration | done, p: Build
    -> Auth Service | done
  MFA Rollout | doing, p: Launch
    -> SSO Integration | done
  RBAC Engine | doing, p: Build
    -> Auth Service | done
  Session Management | done, p: Build
    -> Auth Service | done
  OAuth2 Provider | todo, p: Design
    -> RBAC Engine | doing

// ── Payments ────────────────────────────────────────────────

[Payments] | t: Platform, pri: P0
  Payment Gateway | done, p: Build
  Billing Engine | doing, p: Build
    -> Payment Gateway | done
  Invoice API | todo, p: Design
    -> Billing Engine | doing
  Subscription Manager | todo, p: Design
    -> Billing Engine | doing
    -> Invoice API | todo
  Refund Service | blocked, p: Build
    -> Payment Gateway | done
    -> Billing Engine | doing
  Tax Calculator | na, p: Maintenance

// ── Search & Discovery ──────────────────────────────────────

[Search & Discovery] | t: Backend, pri: P1
  Search API | done, p: Build
  Search UI | doing, p: Build, t: Frontend
    -> Search API | done
  Autocomplete | doing, p: Build
    -> Search API | done
  Faceted Filters | todo, p: Design, t: Frontend
    -> Search API | done
  Search Analytics | na, p: Maintenance, t: Data
  Recommendation Engine | todo, p: Design, t: Data
    -> Search API | done
    -> Search Analytics | na

// ── Content Management ──────────────────────────────────────

[Content Management] | t: Frontend, pri: P1
  CMS Core | done, p: Build
  Media Pipeline | doing, p: Build, t: Platform
    -> CMS Core | done
  Template Engine | done, p: Build
    -> CMS Core | done
  Localization | todo, p: Design
    -> CMS Core | done
    -> Template Engine | done
  A/B Testing | blocked, p: Build
    -> CMS Core | done
    -> Template Engine | done

// ── Observability ───────────────────────────────────────────

[Observability] | t: DevOps, pri: P1
  Metrics Pipeline | done, p: Build
  Alert Rules | done, p: Build
    -> Metrics Pipeline | done
  Dashboard | doing, p: Build, t: Frontend
    -> Metrics Pipeline | done
    -> Alert Rules | done
  Log Aggregation | done, p: Build
  Distributed Tracing | doing, p: Build
    -> Metrics Pipeline | done
    -> Log Aggregation | done
  SLO Monitoring | todo, p: Design
    -> Metrics Pipeline | done
    -> Alert Rules | done

// ── Data Platform ───────────────────────────────────────────

[Data Platform] | t: Data, pri: P2
  Data Lake | done, p: Build
  ETL Pipeline | doing, p: Build
    -> Data Lake | done
  Data Catalog | todo, p: Design
    -> Data Lake | done
  ML Feature Store | todo, p: Design
    -> ETL Pipeline | doing
    -> Data Lake | done
  Data Governance | blocked, p: Build
    -> Data Catalog | todo
  Real-time Streaming | doing, p: Build, t: Platform
    -> Data Lake | done

// ── Cross-group dependencies ────────────────────────────────

Auth Service -> Payment Gateway: validates | done
SSO Integration -> Search API: provides identity | done
Metrics Pipeline -> Search API: monitors | done
Metrics Pipeline -> Payment Gateway: monitors | done
Auth Service -> CMS Core: authenticates | done
RBAC Engine -> CMS Core: authorizes | doing
Data Lake -> Search Analytics: feeds | done
Log Aggregation -> ETL Pipeline: streams logs | doing
MFA Rollout -blocks-> Subscription Manager | doing
Dashboard -> Data Lake: queries metrics | doing
